# R4 — operation sweep. Addition is R1; sub/mul are circle-isomorphic (basis-freeness),
# div likewise. The genuinely non-cyclic test is R9.
# Step budget raised to 60k on 2026-08-24: the measured grokking step for this
# recipe is 25.7k-34.7k, so a 40k budget leaves no post-transition plateau.
+experiment=tf_mod97_grok data=mod_sub_p97 seed=0 train.capture_representations=false train.n_snapshots=150 train.steps=60000
+experiment=tf_mod97_grok data=mod_sub_p97 seed=1 train.capture_representations=false train.n_snapshots=150 train.steps=60000
